      "id": "cls0-desc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 436,
      "text": "CLASS: Customer: A registered shopper\nwith a profile, addresses, and order\nhistory.\n\nMETHODS:\n+ register(email, password): Create a\nnew customer account.\n\n+ login(password): Verify credentials\nand start a session.\n\n+ add_address(address): Attach a\nshipping or billing address.\n\n+ place_order(cart): Convert a cart into\na confirmed order.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CLASS: Customer: A registered shopper\nwith a profile, addresses, and order\nhistory.\n\nMETHODS:\n+ register(email, password): Create a\nnew customer account.\n\n+ login(password): Verify credentials\nand start a session.\n\n+ add_address(address): Attach a\nshipping or billing address.\n\n+ place_order(cart): Convert a cart into\na confirmed order.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 18
    },
