      "type": "text",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 1580,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 358,
      "text": "CLASS: Product: A sellable item\nin the catalog.\n\nMETHODS:\n+ is_in_stock(qty): Check whether\nthe requested quantity is\navailable.\n\n+ reserve(qty): Decrement stock\nwhen an order is placed.\n\n+ apply_discount(pct): Return the\ndiscounted price.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CLASS: Product: A sellable item\nin the catalog.\n\nMETHODS:\n+ is_in_stock(qty): Check whether\nthe requested quantity is\navailable.\n\n+ reserve(qty): Decrement stock\nwhen an order is placed.\n\n+ apply_discount(pct): Return the\ndiscounted price.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 18
    },
