      "id": "cls7-desc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 2542,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 410,
      "text": "CLASS: Order: A confirmed purchase\nmoving through fulfillment.\n\nMETHODS:\n+ confirm(payment): Mark the order as\npaid and ready to fulfill.\n\n+ ship(carrier, tracking_no): Mark as\nshipped and notify the customer.\n\n+ cancel(reason): Cancel the order\nand trigger refund/restock.\n\n+ refund(): Issue a refund to the\noriginal payment method.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CLASS: Order: A confirmed purchase\nmoving through fulfillment.\n\nMETHODS:\n+ confirm(payment): Mark the order as\npaid and ready to fulfill.\n\n+ ship(carrier, tracking_no): Mark as\nshipped and notify the customer.\n\n+ cancel(reason): Cancel the order\nand trigger refund/restock.\n\n+ refund(): Issue a refund to the\noriginal payment method.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 18
    },
